.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F8d72f45a-93bd-46a9-b6e1-7f3205f8deff_5712x4284.jpeg 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\" fetchpriority=\"high\"></picture><div class=\"image-link-expand\"><div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset\"><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke=\"var(--color-fg-primary)\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><g><path d=\"M2.53001 7.81595C3.49179 4.73911 6.43281 2.5 9.91173 2.5C13.1684 2.5 15.9537 4.46214 17.0852 7.23684L17.6179 8.67647M17.6179 8.67647L18.5002 4.26471M17.6179 8.67647L13.6473 6.91176M17.4995 12.1841C16.5378 15.2609 13.5967 17.5 10.1178 17.5C6.86118 17.5 4.07589 15.5379 2.94432 12.7632L2.41165 11.3235M2.41165 11.3235L1.5293 15.7353M2.41165 11.3235L6.38224 13.0882\"></path></g></svg></button><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2\"><polyline points=\"15 3 21 3 21 9\"></polyline><polyline points=\"9 21 3 21 3 15\"></polyline><line x1=\"21\" x2=\"14\" y1=\"3\" y2=\"10\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"10\" y1=\"21\" y2=\"14\"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a></figure></div><p><em>This is important, heartbreaking, and great writing.   I love you, and Jake, and I am proud of you.   Everyone should know, but couldn’t really ever understand, you are good, and love is good, even when life is cruel.  Thank you for all the things you are, you do, and will be.</em></p><p class=\"button-wrapper\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://thefrontierpsychiatrists.substack.com/p/read-this-other-thing-i-did-not-write?utm_source=substack&utm_medium=email&utm_content=share&action=share&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Share&quot;,&quot;action&quot;:null,&quot;class&quot;:null}\" data-component-name=\"ButtonCreateButton\"><a class=\"button primary\" href=\"https://thefrontierpsychiatrists.substack.com/p/read-this-other-thing-i-did-not-write?utm_source=substack&utm_medium=email&utm_content=share&action=share\"><span>Share</span></a></p><p></p><p></p>","text":"The frontier psychiatrists is a daily newsletter, and today is the 499th post. Today, I am going to encourage you to read someone else’s writing instead:\n\nEverything Is An Emergency\n\nIn defense of boring.\n\nIf you find this piece worthwhile, consider the Go Fund Me that’s funding Jake’s ongoing cancer care. Boring doesn’t spew acid out of a hole in its stomach, or randomly cough up blood one otherwise average morning, or announce that it’s considering suicide…\n\nRead more\n\n3 years ago · 16 likes · 2 comments · Bess Stillman\n\nWhat follows is an open letter to , who I know personally:\n\nThis is important, heartbreaking, and great writing. I love you, and Jake, and I am proud of you. Everyone should know, but couldn’t really ever understand, you are good, and love is good, even when life is cruel. Thank you for all the things you are, you do, and will be.\n\nShare"}